1
00:00:00,903 --> 00:00:02,803
(Bernadette:)Yeah, we just want to have
the kind of dinner

2
00:00:02,805 --> 00:00:04,505
(Bernadette:)that we've all had here
so many times before.

3
00:00:04,506 --> 00:00:07,276
(Howard:)Good food, good friends, and
sometime around midnight,

4
00:00:07,276 --> 00:00:09,846
(Howard:)heartburn that makes
you pray for death.

5
00:00:10,978 --> 00:00:12,978
(Amy:)Do you need any help
in the kitchen?

6
00:00:12,981 --> 00:00:15,451
(Bernadette:)No, we got it. You guys
make yourselves comfortable.

7
00:00:17,084 --> 00:00:20,154
(Penny:)All right, hey, you two, we're
here for Howard right now, okay?

8
00:00:20,155 --> 00:00:22,225
(Amy:)Yes, so please
behave yourselves.

9
00:00:22,224 --> 00:00:23,954
(Leonard:)Fine.
Of course.

10
00:00:26,794 --> 00:00:29,694
(Stuart:)So I heard you two, uh,
wrote a paper together.

11
00:00:29,698 --> 00:00:30,928
(Stuart:)How's that going?

12
00:00:34,902 --> 00:00:36,942
(Penny:)This food is amazing.

13
00:00:36,939 --> 00:00:39,539
(Raj:)Mm, and not
a vegetable in sight.

14
00:00:39,541 --> 00:00:40,811
(Howard:)That's not true.

15
00:00:40,809 --> 00:00:42,279
(Howard:)We've got tomatoes right here.

16
00:00:44,846 --> 00:00:48,246
(Amy:)All these bright people sitting
around a table by candlelight.

17
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:51,450
(Amy:)Feels like we could be an
18th century French salon.

18
00:00:51,453 --> 00:00:52,923
(Sheldon:)Indeed.

19
00:00:52,921 --> 00:00:56,091
(Sheldon:)Penny, a salon is a gathering

20
00:00:56,091 --> 00:00:58,191
(Sheldon:)where intellectuals
entertained each other

21
00:00:58,193 --> 00:01:00,563
(Sheldon:)with sparkling conversations
about issues of the day.

